 "finding": "Every task is admissible under a binary built from main's runtime once the foe episode may execute /usr/lib/cargo/bin/coreutils. On this host /usr/bin/mkdir, /usr/bin/sleep, and the other coreutils programs are links into that directory, and main's runtime checks an execute grant against the program the link resolves to. Without the grant the check suite's first mkdir ends with the shell's 'Permission denied', which the report without_tool_root records for all eleven tasks. The runtime needs no repair for admission: a run on such a host names the directory under tool_roots, and admission.py names it with --tool-root.",
